    },
    {
      "id": "x7lu0cv",
      "type": "list",
      "items": [
        "Fixed size; contiguous memory allocation; random access in O(1)",
        "1D, 2D (Matrix), Multi-dimensional arrays",
        "Types: Static (compile-time), Dynamic (runtime — ArrayList in Java, list in Python)",
        "Row-major order (C/C++) vs Column-major order (Fortran, MATLAB)",
        "Sparse matrix: most elements zero; represented using linked list or 3-tuple format"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "8mee5re",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Linked Lists"
    },
    {
      "id": "6kjb5go",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Type</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Structure</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Advantage</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Disadvantage</strong></p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Singly Linked List</p>",
            "<p>Node → Node → NULL</p>",
            "<p>Simple; efficient insert/delete at head</p>",
            "<p>No backward traversal; O(n) access</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Doubly Linked List</p>",
            "<p>NULL ← Node ↔ Node → NULL</p>",
            "<p>Bidirectional traversal; O(1) delete with pointer</p>",
            "<p>Extra memory for prev pointer</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Circular Linked List</p>",
            "<p>Last node points to head</p>",
            "<p>Useful for round-robin scheduling</p>",
            "<p>Complex traversal; need flag to stop</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Circular Doubly</p>",
            "<p>Both directions + circular</p>",
            "<p>Most flexible; used in advanced applications</p>",
            "<p>Most complex; most memory</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
