          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Divide and Conquer</p>",
            "<p>Split problem; solve subproblems; combine</p>",
            "<p>Merge Sort, Quick Sort, Binary Search, Karatsuba multiplication, Strassen's matrix</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Dynamic Programming</p>",
            "<p>Overlapping subproblems + optimal substructure; memoisation/tabulation</p>",
