          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Backtracking</p>",
            "<p>Explore all paths; abandon invalid paths early</p>",
            "<p>N-Queens, Sudoku Solver, Hamiltonian Path, Subset Sum, Graph Colouring</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Branch and Bound</p>",
            "<p>Systematic enumeration; prune branches exceeding best solution</p>",
