          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Randomised Algorithms</p>",
            "<p>Use random numbers in logic; Las Vegas vs Monte Carlo</p>",
            "<p>Randomised Quick Sort, Skip Lists, Bloom Filters, Miller-Rabin primality</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
